### Izdelaj dogodek
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dogodki
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "ignored",
  "ime": "Koncert v Kinu Šiška",
  "cena": 25.5,
  "datum": "2026-12-01T20:00:00+01:00",
  "lokacija": {
    "ime": "Kino Šiška",
    "naslov": "Trg prekomorskih brigad 3, Ljubljana"
  }
}

### Pridobi vse dogodke
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dogodki
Accept: application/json
